# Linux boot check (tools/linux_run.py): from the first save into the city -- the game loads the newest save by
# itself at boot (pgo_save.steps) -- with game-side shots and X screen shots once the world is drawn (the GAME
# writes anchor.flag on its first world frame, PS3RECOMP_ENG_WORLD_MARK, not in the first 20 s after the first
# present). Correctness only: a slow GPU (or llvmpipe) takes its time.
#! seconds 900
#! savefrom work\saves\first-save\gamedata
#! worldmark 20
sleep 15
xshot boot15
anchorfile 840
at 5
shot world5
xshot world5
at 30
shot world30
at 60
shot world60
xshot world60
close
